com/godotengine/godot/pull/112097.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Fixes #66347\r\nThis PR adds `FileSystemDock::get_selected_items()` to complement `FileSystemDock::get_selected_paths()`. It returns a new struct, `PathSelection`, which tracks if the selected path comes from favorites or not. This makes it possible then to serialize that struct to a Dictionary in order to be saved in `editor_layout.cfg` and to be parsed from it.\r\n\r\nGodot 4 MRP for #66347:\r\n[66347.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23169201/66347.zip)\r\n\r\n### Fixes #112091\r\nWith the addition of `FileSystemDock::get_selected_items()`, `FileSystemDock::get_selected_paths()` can now filter out double entries. I added logic to remove paths both selected by a favorite item and it's non-favorited counterpart.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112097/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112097/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}